    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b0f23ce704a4cac1f92d1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿，觉醒④",
      "source_fingerprint": "78bf10d4ae0fed972e93235de84fcd6d5de048a6050993820f8312f5d145f5ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8063bfd72626bda99acf5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想让待在故乡美国的家人\n瞧瞧自己活跃的模样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4875d8c8366478c08b2d84973af51d073ff293f211bbc576c25b8e04bba94ff8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a9555d658ef4ab390505fa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "努力为大树快车完成这份梦想的日子\n就此开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7c13e71fbcc9e455d5261154cb683a880affd8ff9b830f61ad74e6e690cd7d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d77559ad77cf74d570d0f00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b5a45a6c3de015eb2babc8ccd5ddd87f0067ee0ff12a87a5c5341ef47fc2272",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d54b51e26c081e5a440aaca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“年度代表赛马娘”……\n这是指闪耀系列赛之中\n最为耀眼的特别赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f223129b8946624644c299d4cc0bb277dac1dcdcfce4f885a058530f0d35a94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f14d01baee0fa3fbce142402",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车为了让许多人感到开心，\n下定决心要成为“年度代表赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c762eab437aa042dbe7383430ef336157983a6c8253a3819cc64c5910873cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3414ce6bd6ec8acc3fded7a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，大树快车开始朝着那份\n远大无比的梦想起步奔驰了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a78be270ee174afff788fac21792f6570520a129217bf2972fc2ec48134063",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3012c0f1a93cb505b082e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在竞赛之中，找到dream",
      "source_fingerprint": "36d5439dccd169f2df813f18bee2031d73f75733f872519ad81ffb5ee87987ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa164cb76a4b6bab350a601",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车在乙名史记者的采访中，\n回答自己是以“年度代表赛马娘”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7597e35b7ba89708b45b26d84209f6cdce6319a9efb9b85cf0e428e7f3a11de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd3428cde5706c0d24a9e9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "乙名史记者不禁对她这番话感到惊讶。\n这是因为，短距离项目的选手\n从来没有入选过年度代表赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6cc4ffeeed61b7ca8df30f8deeb57805e38eb9508c4c8432d175c5e3f46b93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5fa0207f248869d822667fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是史无前例的挑战……\n但这对大树快车来说只是小问题罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8631d05f5edecc0ffd9fbc240b43ce8d2afb949a5cadc733a7522e867ea04e90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7cc4f37a55dc9a9330b040d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车……她活力十足地回答说，\n如果还没有人获选，那自己就要成为第一个\n短距离出身的年度代表赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d27dd30197e04eb55279be07793092e45d12f6a525db0673f51016d86ee5adf7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc0b06277434efb4aa30044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拓荒者的精神",
      "source_fingerprint": "27736c677e3a2a42f77bcf07372ba1efef928541242bfb51dbee02c5daeef1b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a783e43852c6e67daeb6667",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车正为了“英里冠军赛”\n而努力训练着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a078eb89c8992d30d10da49b9545acefb23528e233718a9fdeed1621c69b4fd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b164f469598524da8a3c30cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，她知道了自己的好朋友无声铃鹿，\n也要参加“英里冠军赛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22373241470b4f112848205682db6c4db3500823ad32c13411f974682d8ce6d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43cb2b4fe49b029911243d77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿表示，为了掌握跑法中缺少的\n“某些部分”，自己要挑战各式各样的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2694d1eac1e7e5716d0776e59cdcb165a3a0b8d2fd3988f23785ef86c3ef4833",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7ef2cb74a07d3f27c33f40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对劲敌参战，大树快车的斗志急速上升。\n努力训练中的她，干劲比平时还要旺盛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f24c8545ece281e92d48653313573bb4c6c4960e63fae3ae07c7057cf84a7c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
